58,"height":34},{"text":"가\u0026","x":913,"y":1648,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"용량도","x":984,"y":1648,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"줄어든다는","x":1088,"y":1648,"width":157,"height":35},{"text":"점입니다.","x":1257,"y":1646,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"다음","x":1405,"y":1646,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"그림","x":1483,"y":1645,"width":65,"height":35}]},{"text":"의 큐는 초기 용량이 8개였지만, 제거 연산을 4차례 수행했더니 용량이 반(4) 밖에 남지 않았습니","words":[{"text":"의","x":178,"y":1720,"width":29,"height":35},{"text":"큐는","x":220,"y":1721,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"초기","x":292,"y":1719,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"용량이","x":364,"y":1717,"width":89,"height":37},{"text":"8개였지만,","x":466,"y":1715,"width":149,"height":38},{"text":"제거","x":631,"y":1716,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"연산을","x":706,"y":1717,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"4차례","x":808,"y":1716,"width":78,"height":36},{"text":"수행했더니","x":899,"y":1716,"width":150,"height":36},{"text":"용량이","x":1064,"y":1716,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"반(4)","x":1169,"y":1715,"width":82,"height":36},{"text":"밖에","x":1267,"y":1715,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"남지","x":1342,"y":1715,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"않았습니","x":1417,"y":1714,"width":130,"height":35}]},{"text":"다. 게다가 후단도 배열 끝에 도달했습니다. 이 큐는 수명이 다 돼서 얼마 안 가 작동 불능 상태에 빠","words":[{"text":"다.","x":177,"y":1787,"width":38,"height":37},{"text":"게다가","x":228,"y":1787,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"후단도","x":328,"y":1786,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"배열","x":432,"y":1784,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"끝에","x":501,"y":1783,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"도달했습니다.","x":573,"y":1783,"width":191,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":779,"y":1784,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"큐는","x":818,"y":1785,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"수명이","x":890,"y":1784,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"다","x":992,"y":1784,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"돼서","x":1033,"y":1784,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"얼마","x":1106,"y":1783,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"안","x":1178,"y":1782,"width":32,"height":3